# Raw law corpus + resumable build artifacts produced by the search-cache
# harvest. The corpus can grow to hundreds of MB / tens of thousands of files;
# never commit the raw XML/HTML. The derived caches are also NOT committed:
# the full-corpus search-cache.json is ~285 MB raw / ~48 MB gzipped, so it (and
# the case-law cache) ship as GitHub Release assets fetched at Docker build time
# (see backend/Dockerfile, DATA_RELEASE_TAG) rather than bloating git history.
backend/search/data/search-cache.json
backend/search/data/search-cache.json.gz
backend/search/data/case-law-cache.json
backend/search/data/case-law-cache.json.gz
backend/search/data/data.sqlite
backend/search/data/laws/
backend/search/data/laws-html/
